## Conventions (non-negotiable)
- Grid shape: `grid.shape == (H, W)` meaning `(rows, cols)`.
- Indexing: always `grid[r, c]`.
- Coords: always `(r, c)`.
- BBox: `(r0, c0, r1, c1)` inclusive.
